      "value": "ONLY on VRChat happens this prob  (Mobile)\n\nPhone:\n\n[Samsung Galaxy A53 5G]\n\nAndroid vers: 14\n\nchipset: Exynos 1280 (5nm)\n\nCPU: octa-core\n\nGPU: Mali-G68\n\nVideo : 4k@30fps, 1080@30/60fps; gyro-EIS\n\nEarbuds: \n\n[Beats Studio Buds]\n\nNoise cancelling\n\nCustom Acoustic Platform\n\n(i dont have the instruccions or box to see the details so il investigate)\n\nthis is my two device description,\n\nto tell you more detail what happened , i play normally with my earbuds on any random mobile games  ,when i tested on vrchat , it was fine at the beginning but after some time playing the game  got frozen wich is the lag n then like 2 sec of waiting it unfroze the game n i couldnt hear any sound or voice on vrchat , what i did is to get out the page of the application n tap the page again on vrchat where i was n then its fixed but it doesnt last long be crystal clear until it lags n be deaf again after trying that multiple times to avoid being deaf until it crash the game n sometimes force me to be on the start menu \n\nNote:\n\nthis happens without earbuds as well (my phone speakers), it all started when i put my earbuds n started affecting this type of weird lag n bug\n\nIf this is not enough information, idk what else can i do to help you bc i cant show you a vid in this site for some reason where i took it as Evidence",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
